of garment-making expertise on the planet. Factories here specialize in knitwear,
woven garments, denim, activewear, and technical apparel. Lead times are
competitive | 30 to 45 days for bulk production | and the export infrastructure
connecting Dhaka and Chittagong to global ports is mature and reliable.
</p>
